{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-choice-n37-quadratic-C",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Completed two-function candidate for q28 option C.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Deliberate negative normalized parabola under both parameter headings. The a>0 panel is wrong (draws y/|a|=-x^2); the a<0 panel retains its correct -x^2. Normalized y/|a| axes visibly prevent inventing a fixed parameter. Both origins are zero, x unit 72 and normalized vertical unit 40. Layout repair only: x tick labels are +/-1.5, y ticks are +/-3 vertical base units (numeric +/-5.19 or +/-44.4; normalized +/-3); Origin (0,0) is captioned below. All curve segment coordinates are unchanged.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s2-n37",
        "exercise": "795",
        "text": "795. 画出下列各函数的大致图像，并指出函数递增和递减时自变量取值的区间：\na) $y=1.73x^2$；\nb) $y=-14.8x^2$；\nc) $y=ax^2$，其中 $a>0$；\nd) $y=ax^2$，其中 $a<0$。"
      }
    ],
